cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OpenDubs in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "OpenDubs: a low-cost, open-source mobile robot"
abstract: >-
  OpenDubs is a low-cost, low-fabrication, open-source mobile robot platform built from mostly
  off-the-shelf parts (NVIDIA Jetson AGX Thor, M5Stack StampPLC/Tab5, goBILDA/REV structure,
  mecanum drive) with open firmware, software, and hardware designs so others can replicate it.
type: software
